#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_310p_qwen35.rst:26
msgid ""
"The attention operator may require a large uncompressed mask. This explanation is "
"unconfirmed; it is not evidence of a universal model or hardware limit."
msgstr "注意力運算元可能需要較大的未壓縮掩碼。這一解釋尚未確認，不能據此認定模型或硬體存在通用限制。"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_310p_qwen35.rst:29
msgid "Verification and reference"
msgstr "驗證與參考"

#. Reviewed technical translation.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/ascend_310p_qwen35.rst:31
msgid ""
"Check the effective context limit after startup and verify inference within that "
"limit. Record the exact backend and image versions when reproducing the case."
msgstr "啟動後檢查實際生效的上下文長度，並在此範圍內驗證推理。復現時記錄準確的後端和映象版本。"

